{"id":849,"date":"2025-10-24T01:07:23","date_gmt":"2025-10-24T01:07:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/?page_id=849"},"modified":"2026-03-17T12:58:53","modified_gmt":"2026-03-17T12:58:53","slug":"company","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/company\/","title":{"rendered":"Company"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-849\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-849-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\" ><div class=\"panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-849-0\" ><div id=\"pgc-849-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-849-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child\" data-index=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #333333;\">Company<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: helvetica; padding-bottom: 10px !important; color: #333333;\">Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. is ACRA -registered entity that has been operating for 13 + years in Ireland since its incorporation in 2013. Officially, Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. is registered as Private Limited Company with its address 37 Dicksons Wood, Moyraverty, Craigavon, Northern Ireland, BT65 5FA Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. is a well known listed entity in the private market with UEN no 201325929G. As of 1st October 2025, the company is not involved in any litigation based on the public records of the Supreme Court of Ireland. This information is provided to the best of our research ability and we make no warranties over any data inaccuracies or omissions.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;\"><strong>We are dominance when it comes to reliable tanks storage, vessel ships and trucks tankers<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;\">Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. is a leading prime company in liquid tank storage and freight with a global network handling a broad range of products from chemicals, gases and fuels to new energy products. We bring decades of old experience, a future-focused, holistic approach and a truly ambitious ESG agenda. Continuing a tradition of being capable, safe and reliable operations, and consistent delivery, we build and work together towards future-focused solutions for our customers and partners.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;\">A company established in Ireland with large fleets of tanks, vessels and trucks, we are strategically focused in running almost all oil and gas energy transactions, for our vessels are all mainly leased all over the world by reputable companies\u00a0for there is a proof of our dominance in the oil and gas industry.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #333333;\"><strong>Growth and Transformations<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #333333;\">This world needs economic growth and sustainable development. It is our main focus and ambition within the industry to be the preferred company for progress in the energy sector. We address uncertainty through an agile and adaptable approach that makes the best use of new technology. We are committed to this transformation, in close cooperation with other important companies along the value chain.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"host-lopnbnfpjmgpbppclhclehhgafnifija\" style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2147483647;\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"host-lopnbnfpjmgpbppclhclehhgafnifija\" style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2147483647;\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"host-lopnbnfpjmgpbppclhclehh